  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with <br>boiling water.<br>• Cook udon noodles over medium-high heat, <br>gently stirring with a fork to separate, until <br>tender, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Drain, rinse and set aside. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-46122900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.<br>• Roughly chop Asian greens.<br>• Thinly slice flat mushrooms (see ingredients) and <br>long chilli (if using).<br>• Finely chop garlic.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-59cb7d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Using your hands, crumble firm tofu<br>(see ingredients) into 1cm chunks.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine tofu, Asian BBQ<br>seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-436c6920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat.<br>• When oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, <br>until golden, 5-7 minutes.<br>• Remove pan from heat, then stir in half the <br>soy sauce mix and a splash of water, until tofu is <br>well coated. <br>• Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-b33a2e30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Wipe out frying pan and return to high heat with <br>a drizzle of olive oil. Cook mushrooms, until just <br>softened, 2-3 minutes.<br>• Add carrot and cook until tender, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Reduce heat to medium, then add Asian greens and <br>garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.<br>• Add cooked udon noodles, hoisin sauce, remaining <br>soy sauce mix, the vinegar and a good splash of <br>water, tossing to combine. Season with pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-a00cbc40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide mushroom udon noodles between bowls.<br>• Top with Chinese BBQ crumbled tofu. <br>• Garnish with chilli to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886ef42b6ffa7a20c3b9a09/step-bea8c950.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
